--------------------------- Changelog -----------------------------

1.0.c
Added - Reset layout setting: turn it on and save to put the default wheel back
Note - Turn it off again before the next reset
Adjusted - Updated to 0.98.5a
Fixed - Crash when a submenu uses an icon from a mod that is no longer enabled

1.0.b
Adjusted - The default hotkey is now left Alt, with B and right Ctrl as the other two defaults. Left Ctrl no longer opens the wheel by default
Note - If you saved the mod's LunaLib settings before, your hotkeys stay as they were

1.0.a
Added - Initial Release
